  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nGiven equation: **74 – 52 + (39 ÷ 13) × 16 + (14 ÷ 2) = 106**\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **74 and 52**\n\n→ 52 – 74 + **(39 ÷ 13)** × 16 + **(14 ÷ 2)** = 106\n\n→ 52 – 74 + **3 × 16** + 7 = 106\n\n→ **52** – 74 **+ 48 + 7** = 106\n\n→ 107 – 74 = 106\n\n→ 33 ≠ 106\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **52 and 39**\n\n→ 74 – 39 + **(52 ÷ 13)** × 16 + **(14 ÷ 2)** = 106\n\n→ 74 – 39 + **4 × 16** + 7 = 106\n\n→ **74** – 39 **+ 64 + 7** = 106\n\n→ 145 – 39 = 106\n\n→ 106 = 106\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\n3) **14 and 52**\n\n→ 74 – 14 + **(39 ÷ 13)** × 16 + **(52 ÷ 2)** = 106\n\n→ 74 – 14 + **3 × 16** + 26 = 106\n\n→ **74** – 14 **+ 48 + 26** = 106\n\n→ 148 - 14 = 106\n\n→ 134 ≠ 106\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) **14 and 16**\n\n→ 74 – 52 + **(39 ÷ 13)** × 14 + **(16 ÷ 2)** = 106\n\n→ 74 – 52 + **3 × 14** + 8 = 106\n\n→ **74** – 52 **+ 48 + 8** = 106\n\n→ 130 – 52 = 106\n\n→ 78 ≠ 106\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****52 and 39\"**.",
